  "transcriber_notes": [
   "〃 (ditto) in the year labels expanded to the era; 決算 (大正14-昭和7) and 豫算 (昭和8-9) are brace labels printed beside the years and written in front of the year.",
   "Rows: 10 year rows + 1 總額 row + 47 prefectures as printed.",
   "Row '德島', col '役場費': [?] — the middle digit of '9?0' is print-damaged, looks like 1 or 4 (910 or 940); the printed totals would be consistent with 940 (column sum and row sum then reconcile to within rounding) but the digit is not settled by reading.",
   "Row '新潟', col '電氣及瓦斯事業費': printed '20' with a red ink dot touching the second digit; read as 20.",
   "Row '神奈川', col '電氣及瓦斯事業費': printed '100' (a red dot sits just below); read as 100.",
   "Row sums of the item columns vs. 總額 differ by 1-3 in most rows (rounding to 千圓). Larger: 大正14 year row items sum 451,925 vs printed 451,915 (+10; every cell re-read, clear); not corrected. 德島 not testable (cell [?]).",
   "Column sums of the 47 prefectures vs. printed 總額 row (德島 役場費 excluded as [?]): 會議費 -1, 土木費 -3, 教育費 -3, 衞生費 +1, 社會事業費 +2, 警備費 +1, 勸業費 +2, 公債費 -2, 諸稅及負擔 -1, 財產造成費管理費及積立金 +5, 電氣及瓦斯事業費 -1, 其他 +1, 總額 reconciles to printed 總額 except as listed in the row checks; all rounding-sized.",
   "總額 row (地方別, 昭和九年度豫算) equals the 昭和9 豫算 year row; its items sum to 460,137 vs 460,140 (-3, rounding)."
  ],
